BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-182448@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260501T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260501T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260501T210000
SUMMARY:Private Screening: The Devil Wears Prada 2
LOCATION:Offsite: Alamo Drafthouse Seaport
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nE
 vent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/182448\n\n6:00PM Doors O
 pen\, 6:30PM Screening\nStep back into the high-stakes world of fashion wi
 th The Devil Wears Prada 2\, where ambition\, reinvention\, and razor-shar
 p wit take center stage. As Andy Sachs navigates the next chapter of her c
 areer\, she’s once again drawn into the orbit of the formidable Miranda 
 Priestly—where the stakes are higher\, the expectations sharper\, and th
 e line between success and sacrifice more blurred than ever. With returnin
 g favorites and new power players\, this stylish sequel delivers drama\, h
 umor\, and an inside look at the ever-evolving world of fashion.\n\nEnjoy 
 convenient seat-side food and beverage service\, available for member purc
 hase from the Alamo concession offerings. Place your order and have it del
 ivered directly to your seat between 6:00pm and 6:30pm.\n\n*This event is 
 complimentary and reserved for members\, plus one registered guest age 16+
 . Tableside food and beverage service is available in the theater from 6:0
 0pm - 6:30pm.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/182448
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
