UID:quin-event-182099@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260507T113000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260507T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260507T130000
SUMMARY:Women\, Worth & Wisdom: The Next Generation of Female Leaders
LOCATION:Bondo
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: $35.00 per person\nStatus: Waitl
 ist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/182099\n\n11:
 30AM Lunch\, 12:00PM Discussion \n\nJoin us for the final installment of 
 our four-part series\, Women\, Worth & Wisdom\, led by Colette Phillips\, 
 founder of Get Konnected. This culminating conversation brings the next ge
 neration of female leaders to the forefront—spotlighting voices across s
 ectors who are shaping the future with intention and impact.\n\nFeaturing 
 Rachel Flor\, Executive Director of the JFK Library Foundation\, Julia Joh
 annsen\, Founder & CEO of The Impact Collective\, Zykera Steward\, Chief o
 f Staff at Get Konnected! and The GK Fund\, and Cherina D. Wright\, Esq.\,
  Assistant Vice President of Student Affairs at Suffolk University\, the p
 anel will explore how today’s emerging leaders are defining success\, pr
 ioritizing purpose\, and driving meaningful change in their work.\n\nToget
 her\, they will reflect on the mentors and moments that shaped their paths
 \, while sharing how they aim to pay it forward—creating space and oppor
 tunity for those just beginning their careers. Engaging and open in spirit
 \, the afternoon invites connection\, reflection\, and dialogue among peer
 s.\n\n*This event is offered at $35 per person\, plus tax\, to account for
  the buffet lunch\, enjoyed during the program. Reservations are open to m
 embers\, plus one guest. Cancellations made within 48 hours of the event a
 re subject to a full charge.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/182099
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
