BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-184226@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260514T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260514
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260515
SUMMARY:New York City Art Excursion
LOCATION:Offsite: New York City
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: $420.56 per person\nStatus: Waitlist
  Only\nTime: 9 AM – 5 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/184226\n\nWe are excited to offer a curated\, behind-the-scenes look 
 at the contemporary art world lead by The ’Quin House art curator\, Kate
  Chertavian.\n\nSpend a private morning at Christie’s\, featuring expert
  insights from leading specialists in Impressionist\, Modern\, and 20th Ce
 ntury art. Through guided discussion and close looking\, members will gain
  a deeper understanding of the auction process and highlights of the May s
 ales.\n\nFrom there\, members will travel to Chelsea for a series of guide
 d gallery visits at David Zwirner\, Hales\, and Hauser & Wirth\, where you
  will experience current exhibitions at some of the most influential galle
 ries in the world.\n\nMidday\, members will gather for a lunch discussion 
 with Kate\, focused on strategies for navigating an art fair and building 
 a thoughtful approach to collecting.\n\nThe afternoon will conclude at Fri
 eze New York at The Shed\, where members will have the opportunity to expl
 ore the fair independently\, applying insights from the day in real time. 
 Throughout the experience\, members will gain behind-the-scenes perspectiv
 e on the art market\, along with Kate’s “5 Things to Know about Collec
 ting.”\n\n9:00AM - 9:15AM | Arrival & Welcome at Christie’s\n9:15AM - 
 11:00AM | Private Viewing at Christie’s\n11:00AM - 11:30AM | Transit to 
 Chelsea\n11:30AM - 1:20PM | Gallery Visits: David Zwirner\, Hales\, Hauser
  & Wirth\n1:30PM - 2:30PM | Lunch & Discussion with Kate Chertavian\n3:00P
 M - 5:00PM | Independent Browsing at Frieze New York\n\nThis intimate\, th
 oughtfully designed program offers a unique opportunity to engage directly
  with experts\, deepen your understanding of the art market\, and experien
 ce New York’s art scene alongside fellow members.\n\n*This excursion is 
 offered to members-only at $450 per person\, including the cost of lunch\,
  group transportation between Christie's and the galleries\, as well as yo
 ur ticket to the Frieze Art Fair. A limited number of spaces are available
  on a first come\, first to reserve basis. Members are responsible for the
 ir own transportation to and from New York. Tickets are non-refundable an
 d non-transferable.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/184226
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
