 : 14 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhous
 e.com/events/184142\n\nSavor an evening designed for meaningful connection
  at this special Serendipity Dinner\, thoughtfully curated for women of Th
 e ’Quin. Gather around an intimate table for a three-course dining exper
 ience\, complemented by expertly paired wines and engaging conversation.\n
 \nWith gentle prompts to guide discussion\, the evening unfolds at an easy
 \, convivial pace—inviting genuine dialogue\, shared stories\, and the o
 pportunity to connect with fellow members in a warm\, welcoming setting. I
 t’s a refined yet relaxed experience where great company and thoughtful 
