BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-169178@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260519T130000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T150000
SUMMARY: 90 Minutes of Innovation: Leadership\, Governance and the Long Vie
 w 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 2 spots left
 \nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/16
 9178\n\n1:00PM Program\, 2:30PM Networking\nWhat does it take to guide ins
 titutions\, advise CEOs\, and shape strategy at the highest levels across 
 decades of transformation?\n\nIn the latest edition of 90 Minutes of Innov
 ation*\, John Werner—venture capitalist\, MIT lecturer\, and *Forbes* AI
  columnist—sits down with David Mussafer\, Chairman of Advent Internatio
 nal and one of the most influential leaders in global private equity.\n\n
 With a career spanning decades\, Mussafer has helped build Advent into on
 e of the world’s top ten private equity firms\, headquartered here in Bo
 ston\, while also advising companies and serving on boards across industri
 es. Drawing from the arc of his life’s work\, the conversation will wea
 ve together personal insights and professional milestones\, offering a pe
 rspective that sits at the intersection of capital\, governance\, and long
 -term value creation—where the biggest decisions are often the least vis
 ible.\n\nTogether\, they will explore what great companies and leadership 
 teams have in common\, how boards actually function—and how they must ev
 olve—the role of private equity in building\, not just acquiring\, compa
 nies\, and how leaders navigate uncertainty\, cycles\, and long-term strat
 egy. The conversation will also draw on lessons from decades of investing 
 across sectors and geographies.\n\nExpect a thoughtful\, behind-the-scenes
  conversation about how decisions get made at the highest levels—where g
 overnance meets growth\, and strategy meets execution.\n\nFrom boardrooms 
 to global markets—one stage\, one conversation\, not to be missed.\n\n*T
 his event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Light bites and 
 refreshments will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/169178
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
