UID:quin-event-183090@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260704T150000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260704
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260707
SUMMARY:'Venture: Wimbledon
LOCATION:Offsite
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Venture - Travel\nPrice: $12850.47 per person\nAva
 ilability: 2 spots left\nStatus: Available\nTime: 3 PM – 12 PM\nEvent UR
 L: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/183090\n\nAn Exclusive Seat at 
 Tennis' Most Iconic Stage. Experience the Prestige of Wimbledon.\nMore tha
 n a visit to London\, this is an invitation to one of sport’s most raref
 ied worlds - Wimbledon... where tradition\, precision\, and quiet luxury c
 onverge on perfectly kept grass courts.\n\nYour weekend centers on Sunday 
 at the All England Lawn Tennis Club\, where members will take their place 
 on Centre Court with coveted Debenture tickets\, among the most exclusive 
 seats in global sport. As the Championships enter the fourth round\, the a
 tmosphere sharpens: the field narrows\, the stakes heighten\, and the game
  reveals its most compelling drama. From this vantage point\, members will
  witness the world’s finest players in matches that will define the traj
 ectory to the finals.\n\nBetween play\, move at your own pace through the 
 grounds - where champagne is poured with ease\, strawberries and cream rem
 ain a ritual\, and every detail reflects Wimbledon’s singular blend of h
 eritage and refinement. This is not simply spectating\; it is participatio
 n in a cultural institution\, experienced as it was intended.\n\nCurated w
 ith intention\, this is an insider experience of Wimbledon at its most ele
 ctric\, shared in the company of those who appreciate it most.\n\nDay One 
 | Saturday\, July 4th\n\nYour journey begins with your arrival in London\,
  where you will be welcomed to The Kensington Hotel\, a refined townhouse 
 known for its polished discretion and residential charm.\n\nOnce checked i
 n\, take a moment to unwind from your travels - whether relaxing in the ho
 tel’s inviting drawing rooms or stepping out to explore the surrounding 
 neighborhood at your leisure. The afternoon is yours to ease into the rhyt
 hm of the city or connect with fellow ‘Quin members as the experience un
 officially begins.\n\nIn the evening\, gather for a 'Quin Member welcome d
 inner hosted by former-Londoner - our very own Managing Director\, Matthia
 s Kiehm at The Audley Public House. The Audley is a proper neighborhood Pu
 b where history and contemporary art collide. Here\, amid thoughtfully res
 tored interiors and a convivial atmosphere\, members will be reintroduced 
 to fellow fans of the sport over a beautifully prepared dinner while antic
 ipating the next days matches.\n\nDay Two | Sunday\, July 5th\n\nYour seco
 nd day begins with a seamless departure from The Kensington Hotel as you m
 ake your way to Wimbledon\, with travel arrangements thoughtfully coordina
 ted for ease and comfort.\n\nUpon arrival at the All England Lawn Tennis C
 lub on "Middle Sunday\," you will have the full day to experience the Gent
 lemen's and Ladies' Singles Fourth Round at your own pace. With Debenture 
 ticket(s) in hand\, enjoy prime seating on Centre Court - where the field 
 narrows and the tournament’s momentum becomes palpable. Your tickets als
 o provide access to No. 1 Court and the outer courts\, allowing you to mov
 e fluidly between matches and take in the breadth of play across the groun
 ds.\n\nThroughout the day\, you will have access to the Debenture Holders�
 �� Lounge and its collection of private bars and dining venues. Whether pa
 using for a leisurely lunch\, a glass of champagne\, or a moment of respit
 e overlooking the courts\, the experience is yours to shape as you wish.\n
 \nFollowing the conclusion of play\, return to London in the early evening
 . Keeping dynamic match times in mind\, the day concludes with a relaxed l
 ate-evening group dinner\, in a stylish yet comfortable setting to unwind 
 and reflect before returning to The Kensington Hotel for a well-deserved n
 ights rest.\n\nDay Three | Monday\, July 6th\n\nYour final morning begins 
 at a relaxed pace with breakfast at The Kensington Hotel. Enjoy a quiet st
 art to the day - whether over a leisurely meal or a final moment of calm i
 n the hotel’s inviting surroundings.\n\nFollowing breakfast\, departures
  will take place on your own schedule - whether returning home\, or stayin
 g on for an independent extension to the trip. As you make your way home\,
  carry with you the memories of a weekend defined by exceptional access\, 
 thoughtful curation\, and the shared experience of Wimbledon at its most c
 ompelling.\n\nClassic Room | Single Occupancy\n\nClassic Room at The Kensi
 ngton Hotel | Two Twin Beds with Breakfast Included\n\nOne Wimbledon Deb
 enture Ticket to the Gentlemen's and Ladies' Singles Fourth Round\, includ
 ing Centre Court seating and the Debenture's Holders' Lounge with its coll
 ection of private bars and dining venues.\n\nTwo curated group dinners\, i
 ncluding a welcome dinner at The Audley Public House.\n\n$7\,950\n\nClassi
 c Room | Double Occupancy\n\nClassic Room at The Kensington Hotel | Queen 
 Bed with Breakfast Included\n\nTwo Wimbledon Debenture Tickets to the Gent
 lemen's and Ladies' Singles Fourth Round\, including Centre Court seating 
 and the Debenture's Holders' Lounge with its collection of private bars an
 d dining venues.\n\nTwo curated group dinners\, including a welcome dinner
  at The Audley Public House.\n\n$13\,750\n\nPlease note the price of airfa
 re is not included in the ticket price. Members and their guests are respo
 nsible for booking their own flights. For the smoothest arrival experience
 \, we recommend flying into London Heathrow Airport (LHR) located less tha
 n an hour by car from The Kensington Hotel.\n\n* Reservations are non-refu
 ndable and non-transferable. Please note that all bookings are subject to 
 the terms and conditions outlined in the final confirmation materials incl
 uding your sign-off on a standard liability waiver.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/183090
CATEGORIES:‘Venture - Travel
END:VEVENT
